Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person4:
	.string "The sea here is so clear you can see\n"
	.string "the WATER MOéMON swimming below.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person5:
	.string "I come here every summer. My MOéMON\n"
	.string "loves the sand.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person6:
	.string "Even fighters need a vacation. I'll\n"
	.string "train twice as hard tomorrow.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person7:
	.string "There's a villa up the hill. I hear it's\n"
	.string "the fanciest place in SINNOH.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person12:
	.string "The water's warm today! Come on in!$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person14:
	.string "My dad brought me here for a vacation.\n"
	.string "I'm going to swim until I'm a prune!$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person15:
	.string "PROF. ROWAN: Even I take a holiday now\n"
	.string "and then. Don't tell my assistants.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person16:
	.string "GARDENIA: The flowers here are\n"
	.string "amazing! I'm taking seeds home for my\l"
	.string "GYM.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person17:
	.string "BYRON: Gahaha! A fine place to rest\n"
	.string "these old bones.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person18:
	.string "ROARK: Dad's here too? Ugh. Can't even\n"
	.string "vacation in peace.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Person19:
	.string "MAYLENE: Resting is training too! ...Is\n"
	.string "that true? I hope that's true.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Sign1:
	.string "RESORT AREA\p"
	.string "Rest and relax by the sea.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Sign2:
	.string "RIBBON SYNDICATE\p"
	.string "Members only.$"

Sinnoh_ResortArea_Text_Sign13:
	.string "THE VILLA\p"
	.string "A place to call your own, by the sea.$"

